<title>UK: SBC sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued 28 tranches of call and put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</p>
<p>There are 14 tranches of dollar denominated warrants and 14 tranches Swiss franc denominated warrants.</p>
<p>The warrants mature on October 22 1997 and the payment date is January 22 1997. Minimum lot for exercise is 100 and one index is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p>Spot reference for all the warrants is $753.23</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
